  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Community Responses to HIV &amp; AIDS in sub-Saharan Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will provide support to Strategies for Hope (SFH) in publishing and distributiung their &apos;Called to Care&apos; materials addresssing issues related to HIV. 

Strategies for Hope Trust began the &#x2018;Called to Care&#x2019; initiative in 2003. The overall aim was to produce and distribute a &#x2018;toolkit&#x2019; of 10 practical, action-oriented workbooks addressing issues related to HIV that would: &#x201c;empower church leaders, their congregations and their communities with the knowledge, attitudes, skills and strategies they need to plan and implement effective responses to the challenges of the HIV epidemic, especially in sub-Saharan Africa.&#x201d; 

SFH&apos;s distributes these workbooks through local partners (many of whom are faith based organisations) across sub-Saharan Africa. CAFOD&apos;s funding of this initative supports SFH&apos;s limited capacity to make its materials available free of charge.</narrative>
  </description>
